Metrics to compute: Ordinary memorization step M_s: first 20-step evaluation with training accuracy 1.0 and training cross-entropy <=0.02., Sustained-95% grokking step: first evaluation beginning six consecutive evaluations over 100 optimizer steps with test accuracy >=0.95; computed separately for ordinary, baseline-fork, and intervention-fork trajectories., Fitted norm threshold T: maximum across seeds of the ordinary total parameter norm at R_s=G_s-2L_s, with L_s=min(400,(G_s-M_s)/3) rounded down to a multiple of 20., Norm-doubling error: |Q_intervention/(2Q0)-1|, required to be <=1e-4 immediately after adding the class-common component., Probability-invariance error: maximum absolute difference over all 961 examples and 31 classes between baseline and intervention softmax probabilities, required to be <=2e-6., Centered-logit invariance error: maximum absolute difference after subtracting each example's class-mean logit, required to be <=2e-5., Threshold-crossing step X_s: first intervention evaluation with effective norm <=T after a preceding evaluation above T; required to exist by D_s+20., Per-seed relative grokking change R_s: |g_int,s-g_base,s|/max(g_base,s,20)., Primary statistic R_max: maximum R_s over the four matched valid seeds; support requires R_max<0.10., Workspace usage: maximum recursively measured output-directory bytes, with a 100 MB hard experiment limit.
